'''Arachne's Sanctuary''' is a sub-location of the [[Spider's Den]].

{{ZoneText|Home of the Keepers.|Arachne's Altar.}}

== Features ==
'''Arachne's Sanctuary''' features a few attractions.

=== Arachne's Altar ===
Arachne's Altar is a structure in the center of '''Arachne's Sanctuary'''. It features various podiums where players can either place {{Green|1}} [[Arachne Crystal]] or {{Green|4}} [[Arachne's Calling]]. The former spawns the stronger version of [[Arachne]], whilst the latter spawns the weaker.

