=== Arachne ===
{{Main|Arachne}}
[[Arachne]] is a {{mcat|boss}} that can be spawned once the player places either {{Green|1}} [[Arachne Crystal]] or {{Green|4}} [[Arachne's Calling]] at [[#Arachne's Altar|Arachne's Altar]]. Once [[Arachne]] has been spawned, all entrances to '''Arachne's Sanctuary''' will be closed off with layers of cobwebs. 

The boss itself roams around '''Arachne's Sanctuary''', taunting players and inflicting damage onto them. Once [[Arachne]]'s health drops, they summon a group of [[Arachne's Brood]]s, and once they are killed, drop a variety of loot that players can collect, depending on their position and how much they contributed to spawning the boss.

